[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0325","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0395","title":"Computalynx CProxy Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Computalynx CProxy Server 3.3 SP2 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 CProxy Server 3.3 SP2 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，危害等级中危。目前已公开 PoC 利用代码，可验证该漏洞的存在。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0395"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 CProxy Server 至 3.3 SP2 以上版本（如厂商仍提供支持），或在网络边界防火墙中限制对 TCP 8080 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 段连接；同时部署入侵检测系统（IDS）规则检测超长 HTTP 请求（超过 247 字节的 GET 请求），拦截恶意载荷。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至仍在安全更新周期内的替代代理服务器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1213","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=007d01bfbf48%24e44f0e40%2401dc11ac%40peopletel.org","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19920","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0395","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0395.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5p4-qw97-m7r5/GHSA-g5p4-qw97-m7r5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0395.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001384.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--75c26508-413b-4a4d-8293-4e71f8cde752.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0323","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0393","title":"KDE kscd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"KDE 桌面环境的 kscd（CD 播放器）程序在处理用户 SHELL 环境变量时存在权限提升漏洞。当用户通过 SHELL 环境变量指定替代程序时，kscd 未正确丢弃其特权权限，导致以提升后的权限执行用户指定的任意程序。攻击者可在本地利用该漏洞，通过设置恶意的 SHELL 环境变量并诱导 kscd 执行，从而获取目标系统的完全控制权限（包括读取、修改、删除任意文件及执行任意命令）。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1、1.1.1、1.2 及 2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0393"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 2.0 以上版本，或安装对应发行版提供的 kscd 安全补丁。如无法升级，可移除 kscd 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /opt/kde/bin/kscd），或限制 kscd 仅允许受信任用户执行，同时在启动 kscd 前手动清除 SHELL 环境变量中的恶意路径作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0172.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/suse_security_announce_50.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1206","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19915","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0393","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0393.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ph8q-v7mf-3mfr/GHSA-ph8q-v7mf-3mfr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0393.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001383.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0320","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0389","title":"MIT Kerberos 4/5 krb_rd_req 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"MIT Kerberos 4 和 5 协议实现中的 krb_rd_req() 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制的 Kerberos 认证请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行并以 root 权限控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Cygnus Network Security 4.0、KerbNet 5.0、MIT Kerberos 4/5 及 RedHat 6.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Exploit-DB 上已有公开利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0389"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:36Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MIT Kerberos 至 1.2.x 或更高版本（krb5-1.1.1 及更早版本受影响），或安装对应发行版的安全补丁：Red Hat Linux 6.2 用户应应用 RHSA-2000-025 提供的更新 krb5 包；FreeBSD 用户应升级至 2000 年 5 月后的安全修复版本。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制对 Kerberos 服务端口（TCP/UDP 88、749）的未授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0184.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-05/0295.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-06.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1220","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19926","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0389.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0389","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0389.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0389.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4jvw-4fhr-v7mv/GHSA-4jvw-4fhr-v7mv.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/K/kerberos_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001381.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f31f31af-8610-4da2-9ce2-4cc8bbb2bc13.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0320.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0312","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0379","title":"Netopia R系列路由器 SNMP表修改漏洞","description":"Netopia R9100 及 R 系列路由器 4.6.2 版本存在 SNMP 表访问控制缺陷，即使管理员已配置禁止修改 SNMP 表，已认证的本地用户仍可绕过限制修改 SNMP 配置。攻击者需拥有路由器本地访问权限，利用该漏洞可篡改 SNMP MIB 表项，导致设备配置信息泄露或网络管理异常。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低，但暴露了路由器权限分离机制的不足。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0379"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:35Z","remediation":"Netopia R9100/R-series 路由器已停止维护，官方不再提供固件更新。建议立即更换为受支持的现代路由器产品。如无法更换，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 在路由器管理界面禁用 SNMP 写操作（SNMP write community）；2) 在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问路由器的 SNMP 端口（UDP 161/162）；3) 将 SNMP 设置为只读模式，禁止通过 SNMP 修改配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.netopia.com/equipment/purchase/fmw_update.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1177","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200005082054.NAA32590%40linux.mtndew.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19901","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0379","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0379.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f085197f4312eebb5b5d2a4ae57205b512d529b1/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p59f-g5mj-4hqq/GHSA-p59f-g5mj-4hqq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0379.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001380.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0328","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0397","title":"Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 会话标识可预测漏洞","description":"EMURL 是一款基于 Web 的电子邮件帐户管理软件，其用户会话 URL 中编码了可预测的标识符，导致远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接访问特制的 URL 来获取其他用户的电子邮件内容。该漏洞影响 Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 版本，攻击者只需知道目标用户的会话 URL 模式即可实施攻击，可能导致用户邮件数据泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0397"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-15T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:37Z","remediation":"Seattle Lab Software Emurl 2.0 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的现代 Web 邮件系统（如 Roundcube、SquirrelMail 等）。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面为 /scripts/emurl/ 目录添加 IP 白名单访问控制或 HTTP 基本认证，限制对 RECMAN.dll 和 MAKEHTML_M.dll 的访问，防止未授权用户利用可预测的会话标识符访问他人邮件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0160.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1203","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0397","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0397.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmvv-4vx6-5fqj/GHSA-xmvv-4vx6-5fqj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0397.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6180dab5-9713-49ee-9b3a-c1812cdb1fb1.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0345","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0345.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0424","title":"George Burgyan CGI Counter 4.0.2/4.0.7 输入验证漏洞","description":"George Burgyan CGI Counter 4.0.2 和 4.0.7 版本存在输入验证漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的查询字符串参数（如 \"count\" 参数）向 CGI 计数器程序发送特制请求，利用程序对用户输入缺乏有效过滤和验证，导致命令注入或任意命令执行。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 CGI Counter 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造包含 shell 元字符（如分号、反引号、管道符）的参数值，在服务器上以 Web 服务器进程权限执行任意系统命令，可能导致服务器完全被攻控。攻击条件为目标服务器部署了受影响版本的 CGI Counter 且 CGI 执行权限配置不当。攻击者可通过构造类似 `/cgi-bin/counter?count=;cat+/etc/passwd` 的恶意 URL 实现远程命令执行，获取服务器敏感信息或进一步控制服务器。建议升级至修复版本或禁用该 CGI 程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0424"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-05-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 George Burgyan CGI Counter 从 4.0.2/4.0.7 升级到最新可用版本或卸载该软件。该软件已停止维护，无法获得安全补丁。作为临时缓解措施，禁止访问 cgie/private 目录并限制 CGI 脚本执行权限至仅限 root 用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19913","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0424.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0424","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0424.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/